<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:10:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>首次公开募股以来，经历了一周的波动后，Anthropic 股价大幅上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</link><description>Anthropic PBC 的股价攀升至 83 美元以上的首次公开募股价格之上，这家人工智能实验室希望以积极的表现结束创纪录的首次亮相后在纳斯达克的首个日历周。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo'&gt;首次公开募股以来，经历了一周的波动后，Anthropic 股价大幅上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic Shares Jump After Volatile First Week Since IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/anthropic-shares-jump-after-volatile-first-week-since-record-ipo</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:49:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</link><description>一项可能重塑全球烟草业的三方协议也可能波及另一个其产品有时与香烟一起消费的行业——啤酒。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake'&gt;奥驰亚对帝国啤酒的兴趣可能也会影响其百威英博股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria’s Interest in Imperial May Affect Its AB InBev Stake&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/altria-s-interest-in-imperial-may-also-affect-its-ab-inbev-stake</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:14:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>香港正在出卖这座曾经的城市</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/hong-kong-is-selling-the-city-it-used-to-be-video</link><description>香港正在将怀旧变成一个蓬勃发展的产业。从时代犯罪剧到电影场景的旅游景点，当地人抓住机会逃离 20 世纪 80 年代和 90 年代。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/hong-kong-is-selling-the-city-it-used-to-be-video'&gt;香港正在出卖这座曾经的城市&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hong Kong Is Selling The City It Used To Be&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/hong-kong-is-selling-the-city-it-used-to-be-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:23:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P 500 Has Best Week Since April 2025 on AI Rally: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Markets Rally as Trabuco Pick Soothes Fiscal Fears&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>